{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A Tactical Card Game for Deckbuilders\u2014 Built for Speed, Depth, and PC Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Luminoria Tactics (LUTA) is a fast-paced, turn-based card battler where every match is a strategic showdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/ba42e6a2b86a6e47a4040c1c4c6de646.poster.avif?t=1773013252\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/ba42e6a2b86a6e47a4040c1c4c6de646.webm?t=1773013252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/ba42e6a2b86a6e47a4040c1c4c6de646.mp4?t=1773013252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br> <br><strong>3D Graphics, Realistic visuals, High Fidelity, High Excitement</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Drop your cards into the 3D arena and watch them transform into fully animated 3D heroes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/c86a930f8fee007497a203510f9e0f16.poster.avif?t=1773013252\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/c86a930f8fee007497a203510f9e0f16.webm?t=1773013252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/c86a930f8fee007497a203510f9e0f16.mp4?t=1773013252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><br><strong><i>With rapid 1v1 gameplay, evolving decks, and dynamic battlefields, LUTA: Luminoria Tactics  delivers a fresh twist to the collectible card genre.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Gameplay Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every match is a tactical sprint. Build an 8-card hero deck,  items and spell decks, and manage your Flux . With no &quot;End Turn&quot; button, your momentum drives the pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>What Makes It Unique?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unlike traditional turn based card games, Luminoria Tactics (LUTA) emphasizes real-time tactical planning, class synergies, and shifting battlefield rules. Each match lasts less than 4 minutes, perfect for competitive bursts of strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd11 <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Fast-Paced Matches</strong> \u2013 Win or lose in under 5 minutes. No time wasted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf <strong>Evolving Hero Cards</strong> \u2013 Level up cards as you play, unlocking new strengths and strategic potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Dynamic Arena Powers</strong> \u2013 Every round can change the rules: Weakest Wins, Class Boosts, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/8c1ea4aef1069bb6aa2cd3db665fcc79.poster.avif?t=1773013252\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/8c1ea4aef1069bb6aa2cd3db665fcc79.webm?t=1773013252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/8c1ea4aef1069bb6aa2cd3db665fcc79.mp4?t=1773013252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Drag, Drop, Dominate</strong> \u2013 Seamless interactions designed for intuitive, strategic control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/4042db9489edf9b6ef0407270f1446d2.poster.avif?t=1773013252\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/4042db9489edf9b6ef0407270f1446d2.webm?t=1773013252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/4042db9489edf9b6ef0407270f1446d2.mp4?t=1773013252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Spells &amp; Items</strong> \u2013 Insert items and Fate Crushers into your cards from your deck to shape your strategy in the moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/dea27d4dc64b20155d6cd41654e64b60.poster.avif?t=1773013252\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/dea27d4dc64b20155d6cd41654e64b60.webm?t=1773013252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/dea27d4dc64b20155d6cd41654e64b60.mp4?t=1773013252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u265f\ufe0f <strong>Deck Building\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Create unique card, item and spell combos to develop endless strategic possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/a8e83328eb1fda26704e4258010bdf89.poster.avif?t=1773013252\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/a8e83328eb1fda26704e4258010bdf89.webm?t=1773013252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/a8e83328eb1fda26704e4258010bdf89.mp4?t=1773013252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f <strong>Wide Range of Arenas\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Battle across unique arenas, each specially crafted to reflect the spirit of its Theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/a15eefd317dd67141e69e48415ec7dd2.poster.avif?t=1773013252\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/a15eefd317dd67141e69e48415ec7dd2.webm?t=1773013252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/a15eefd317dd67141e69e48415ec7dd2.mp4?t=1773013252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Cross-Platform Sync</strong> \u2013 Play your account on both PC and mobile. Your progress goes with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/f9a45243895082a47b0d72749bfad79a.poster.avif?t=1773013252\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/f9a45243895082a47b0d72749bfad79a.webm?t=1773013252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/f9a45243895082a47b0d72749bfad79a.mp4?t=1773013252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc57 <strong>Customizable Avatars\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Express yourself with your avatar, use emotes, dances or pre-defined lines to interact with (or distract) the enemy!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/613235a7e111b072e32b843b4194f74e.poster.avif?t=1773013252\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/613235a7e111b072e32b843b4194f74e.webm?t=1773013252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/613235a7e111b072e32b843b4194f74e.mp4?t=1773013252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Ranking System\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Rise through the ranks, dominate the leaderboard, and enjoy the thrill of competitive play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/7cf53a40549e9202ceb0e12e55576a7f.poster.avif?t=1773013252\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/7cf53a40549e9202ceb0e12e55576a7f.webm?t=1773013252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/7cf53a40549e9202ceb0e12e55576a7f.mp4?t=1773013252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Get ready to outthink, outplay, and outlast.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>This is Luminoria Tactics , built for competitive minds.</strong><br><strong></strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3837500?t=1773013252","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3837500?t=1773013252","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/b9f0924bbbca5cc4dcda2a7f3da38cf808261c17/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773013252","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/b9f0924bbbca5cc4dcda2a7f3da38cf808261c17/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773013252","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cro